; ======================================================================
;  THE ANVIL PICTURE - 76 x 74, R,G,B per pixel, row-major.
;
;  GENERATED by tools/gen_anvil_pic.py from anvil_logo.png. Do not
;  hand-edit. Blitted once, at boot, by DrawAnvilPic in anvil.pi4;
;  read with PeekA(?anvilPix + ...), never Read/Restore (Read strides
;  two bytes whatever the width - Bugs/Open bugs.md).
;
;  Pre-composited on the banner colour DisplayRGB(0,0,40) so the
;  anti-aliased edges fade into the band, not into a black box.
; ======================================================================
